{
    "title": "Contacts : Easy Phone Dialer",
    "description": "Contacts : Easy Phone Dialer App has arrived to replace your old phone view & bring your calling experience to the next level!\r\n\r\nContacts : Easy Phone Dialer App is an easy-to-use free Contacts app\r\nfor Android, optimized for after-call note-taking.\u201d\r\n\u201cAccess to your upcoming events and tasks,\r\noptimized for after-calls\u201d\r\n\u201c Easily create a tasks and events after a call\r\nwhen you need to remember important things\r\nfrom a conversation.\u201d\r\n\r\nContacts : Easy Phone Dialer is a fast dialer for your Android phone, powered with Call Block, Caller ID, Smart Contacts Search, Call Log History, T9, and Beautiful Themes. Replace your stock phone App and take your phone calling experience to the next level. \r\n\r\n\r\nContacts : Easy Phone Dialer app is helps you quickly manage your contact list. Contacts and dialer only takes a few seconds to get in touch with your contacts. Phone Book available with latest smart call management features.\r\n\r\nContacts : Easy Phone Dialer app highly customizable but easy to smart way use  users can see contacts, add a reminder for the call, send a message when you are not able to take calls.\r\n\r\nKey Features: Contacts : Easy Phone Dialer \r\n- Enhanced security for your privacy\r\n- Call blocking and speed dialing\r\n- Intuitive and user-friendly interface\r\n- Import/export your contacts from one place to another\r\n-  Calls spam block\r\n- Birthday reminders\r\n- Calls reminders\r\n- Fast dialer search\r\n-  T9 Dialer - quickly search by name & numbers\r\n- Clean & intuitive design\r\n- Identify unknown calls without internet access\r\n- Modern and customizable design\r\n- Extended Dual SIM support\r\n- Multiple language support\r\n\r\nPowerful contact manager\r\n- Share your contacts as text or vCard\r\n- View desired contact information\r\n- Easily link your similar contacts\r\n- Create and edit contact groups\r\n-Quickly dial your frequently used contacts\r\n-  Smart recent calls grouping\r\nAVAILABLE IN 9 DIFFERENT LANGUAGES\r\nContacts :Easy Phone Dialer app is available in English, Espa\u00f1ol, Fran\u00e7ais, Deutsch, Portugu\u00eas ,Hindi ,Bengali , Arabic ,Bahasa Indonesia\r\nMore languages are being added to Contacts \u2013 Easy Phone Dialer.\r\nContacts : Easy Phone Dialer works faster than any other phone call apps. Dialer provides more of unique features and also includes a built-in theme manager. Try it now for free!\r\nWe highly value our customers. If you have any questions about Contacts Easy Phone app, please reach out to us at: dharmikbhensdadia1997@gmail.com",
